    {
      "text": "陷阱不仅射烧切毒，还能把怪物弹进水里淹死或召唤战士正面作战",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Shoot, scorch, slice. Punch, pierce, poison. Bounce monsters into water to drown them. Summon warriors to fight them.",
