      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "牌组从少量基础陷阱起步，再扩展成能适应不同敌人与地形的复合防线",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Start from a few basic trap cards, and expand to a versatile deck that could stop a variety of enemies in different terrains.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2330870/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "一百多种基地轮换出现，配合四十五类独特敌人持续改变布防问题",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Features - 100+ deadly traps and skills to craft your deck - Upgrades & Inscriptions to beef up your cards - Over 100 cleverly-designed bases to defend - 45 enemies with unique abilities to challenge and destroy",
